<title>USA: US Justice Dept has no comment on Boeing-MD merger.</title>
<headline>US Justice Dept has no comment on Boeing-MD merger.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States Department of Justice declined to comment on Sunday's announcement by Boeing Co and McDonnell Douglas that they would merge.</p>
<p>&quot;The Justice Department has no comment,&quot; said William Brooks, a spokesman for the Justice Department.</p>
<p>Earlier, Boeing and McDonnell Douglas said that they had not yet notified the government of their intention to merge.</p>
<p>Once that notification is formally made, then the government will look into possible anti-trust implications of the merger.</p>
</text>
